# Coding Etiquette

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before writing or editing code or docs. It covers the download hard rule, the `docs/` layout, the
`docs/code/<mirror-path>.md` rule (one doc per source file, same relative path), comment and writing style, and the commit gate
(`scripts/verify.sh`). Update `AGENTS.md`, not this file.
